# Level 4: a feeder tail into a ring (a merge junction: 52 and 63 both
# feed 60), plus a 3-ring. The tail component rests at 4, 5, 6 or 7 items
# (ring full, plus a contiguous suffix of the tail pressed against it).
# 7 items, and 7 = 4 + 3: fix the counts and let the machine settle itself.
name The Feeder
blurb A feeder belt presses into a ring; a junction chooses who enters.
blurb This machine can rest holding 4, 5, 6 or 7 items — the ring full,
blurb and a queue leaning on it. You have one move. Fix the arithmetic;
blurb the machine will do its own settling, and the meter will show you
blurb what settling costs.

chain 50 51 52 60
cycle 60 61 62 63
cycle 70 71 72

items 50 51 52 60 61
items 70 71

mv 1
par 18

row tail 50 51 52
row ring 60 61 62 63
row spare 70 71 72
